        <briefdescription>
<para>Logical <computeroutput>&amp;&amp;</computeroutput> (and) operator. Matches only if at least one operand is of local type (derived from local <computeroutput>op</computeroutput>). </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Lhs_T</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
